  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ChalkQL.Sources 0.6.2 accompanies ChalkQL 0.6.2.\n\n      - **POCO timestamps:** a `DateTime` member at the default `TIMESTAMP(9)` holding an instant after 2262-04-11, such as 9999-12-31 for \"never\", is refused where its table is built or refreshed, naming the table and member, where it was stored as a wrong instant (1816-03-29). Declare such a member `[ChalkColumn(Precision = 6)]`.\n\n      Requires exactly ChalkQL 0.6.2.\n\n      Full release notes:\n      https://github.com/markhammond/chalkql/releases/tag/v0.6.2",
